# Local site review

The approved storyboard has been implemented. Publishing is excluded.

## What to review
- Scroll the map in both directions on desktop and your own phone. Check the introduction, three places, Addis Ababa education, career, methods, all six work items and the close.
- Open work from the scene or the six HTML controls. Confirm scope/attribution and the 2014 story; no invented conference location is printed in the work window.
- Use the ordinary navigation, direct Contact/CV links and Read text view.
- Open `/cv`, try Print / save as PDF, and download the HTML CV. Open the downloaded file without the server if useful.
- Inspect the local share artwork/icon and missing-page screen.
- Existing words are preserved by the user's keep instruction. `/wording` and its scroll previews provide the three whole-beat comparisons required by the skill; switching to a recommendation is optional and requires an actual choice. No alternative was silently applied.

## Evidence and limits
Build, pure tests, type/lint and production browser checks are recorded in handover.md with report paths. Software-rendered phone emulation checks layout and interaction, not real-device frame rate. No real-phone hardware performance claim is made. The user is the final reviewer of wording and personal presentation.

## Actual user review
Pending on this implementation. The earlier user review approved the gallery world change and then the storyboard; it is not recorded as approval of the finished implementation. Record the user's actual feedback here when received. Do not publish as part of that review.

