185 tests, type/lint, final fresh production matrix (0 problems), and 8 interaction/offline groups (0 page errors or external requests) passed. The final matrix is under `site/checks/site/2026-10-31T05-46-10-366Z/`; interaction/print/download evidence is under `site/checks/portfolio/`. Automated and visual checks are complete for the local handoff; actual user review is still pending.
